Sandbox ablation matrix

4.1

Setup

The empirical demonstration in section 5 uses a deliberately small training
configuration: enough to surface the suppression structure cleanly, small
enough to fit a 5-seed × 80-cell sweep in 25 minutes of wall time per stratum
on a single laptop. The full configuration is in Table 1.
