Reviewer-grade tooling catalogue

The section 3.5.1–section 3.5.4 discipline (cf. section 3.5.4 closing paragraph)
is operationalized through eight auxiliary scripts under papers/scripts/
that a reviewer can run to verify each invariant mechanically. Wall-clock
figures below assume a warm cargo cache (prior cargo build --release
